<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name>凉</ttm:name></ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2"><ttm:name>虹夏</ttm:name></ttm:agent><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Daydream café"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="水野朔"/><amll:meta key="album" value="きらら トリビュート コレクション「結束バンドの歌ってみた」"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="JPE302400726"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2657365485"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="550750678"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="3E8NCXlFk8fV0w0Xdn85E1"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1785804388"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Mrs4s"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:36.668"><div begin="0.613" end="3:36.668"><p begin="0.613" end="2.540" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.613" end="0.823">こ</span><span begin="0.823" end="0.993">こ</span><span begin="0.993" end="1.213">ろ</span><span begin="1.213" end="1.400">ぴょ</span><span begin="1.400" end="1.613">ん</span><span begin="1.613" end="1.800">ぴょ</span><span begin="1.800" end="2.013">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2.013" end="2.223">ま</span></span></span><span begin="2.223" end="2.540">ち？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">心儿蹦蹦跳跳，在等待吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro pyonpyon machi?</span></p><p begin="2.603" end="7.380" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">考</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2.603" end="3.203">かんが</span></span></span><span begin="3.203" end="3.433">え</span><span begin="3.433" end="3.600">る</span><span begin="3.600" end="3.813">ふ</span><span begin="3.813" end="3.923">り</span><span begin="3.923" end="4.213">し</span><span begin="4.213" end="4.400">て</span> <span begin="4.400" end="4.570">も</span><span begin="4.570" end="4.803">う</span><span begin="4.803" end="5.213">ちょっ</span><span begin="5.213" end="5.743">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">近</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="5.743" end="6.363">ちか</span></span></span><span begin="6.363" end="6.600">づ</span><span begin="6.600" end="6.773">い</span><span begin="6.773" end="6.960">ちゃ</span><span begin="6.960" end="7.380">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">装作思考的样子，再稍微靠近一点吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kangaeru furi shite mō chotto chikazuichae</span></p><p begin="7.573" end="10.370" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">簡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="7.573" end="8.023">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">単</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="8.023" end="8.433">たん</span></span></span><span begin="8.433" end="8.620">に</span><span begin="8.620" end="9.013">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.013" end="9.600">お</span></span></span><span begin="9.600" end="9.823">え</span><span begin="9.823" end="10.020">な</span><span begin="10.020" end="10.370">いっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易告诉你呢。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kantan ni wa oshienai</span></p><p begin="10.403" end="15.990" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.403" end="10.620">こ</span><span begin="10.620" end="10.823">ん</span><span begin="10.823" end="11.033">な</span><span begin="11.033" end="11.143">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="11.143" end="11.393">す</span></span></span><span begin="11.393" end="11.613">き</span><span begin="11.613" end="11.743">な</span><span begin="11.743" end="12.013">こ</span><span begin="12.013" end="12.220">と</span><span begin="12.220" end="12.760">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.033" end="13.433">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.433" end="13.613">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="13.613" end="13.930">な</span><span begin="13.930" end="15.990">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这么喜欢你这件事，可是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">konna ni suki na koto wa naisho na no</span></p><p begin="14.040" end="16.940" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="14.040" end="14.200">ふ</span><span begin="14.200" end="14.423">わ</span><span begin="14.423" end="14.633">ふ</span><span begin="14.633" end="14.813">わ</span><span begin="14.813" end="15.000">ど</span><span begin="15.000" end="15.223">き</span><span begin="15.223" end="15.400">ど</span><span begin="15.400" end="15.633">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.633" end="15.910">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.910" end="16.233">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="16.233" end="16.433">で</span><span begin="16.433" end="16.623">す</span><span begin="16.623" end="16.940">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho desu yo</span></p><p begin="17.003" end="20.080" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.003" end="17.393">は</span><span begin="17.393" end="17.633">じ</span><span begin="17.633" end="17.833">め</span><span begin="17.833" end="18.003">が</span><span begin="18.003" end="18.220">か</span><span begin="18.220" end="18.393">ん</span><span begin="18.393" end="18.570">じ</span><span begin="18.570" end="18.793">ん</span> <span begin="18.793" end="19.020">つー</span><span begin="19.020" end="19.223">ん</span><span begin="19.223" end="19.383">だ</span><span begin="19.383" end="19.620">つー</span><span begin="19.620" end="19.813">ん</span><span begin="19.813" end="20.080">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开头最重要，先来点小傲娇，再一点点积攒。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hajime ga kanjin tsūn da tsūn da</span></p><p begin="20.213" end="23.300" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="20.213" end="20.620">ふ</span><span begin="20.620" end="20.820">わ</span><span begin="20.820" end="21.013">ふ</span><span begin="21.013" end="21.213">わ</span><span begin="21.213" end="21.403">ど</span><span begin="21.403" end="21.623">き</span><span begin="21.623" end="21.783">ど</span><span begin="21.783" end="22.013">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.013" end="22.323">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.323" end="22.623">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="22.623" end="23.013">だっ</span><span begin="23.013" end="23.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，都说是秘密啦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho datte</span></p><p begin="23.420" end="26.180" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.420" end="23.823">い</span><span begin="23.823" end="23.993">た</span><span begin="23.993" end="24.223">ず</span><span begin="24.223" end="24.420">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.420" end="24.623">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.623" end="25.023">がお</span></span></span><span begin="25.023" end="25.213">で</span><span begin="25.213" end="25.380">ぴょ</span><span begin="25.380" end="25.793">ん</span><span begin="25.793" end="25.960">ぴょ</span><span begin="25.960" end="26.180">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带着调皮的笑容，蹦蹦跳跳。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itazura egao de pyonpyon</span></p><p begin="26.200" end="30.200" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">扉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.200" end="26.833">とびら</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">開</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.833" end="27.000">あ</span></span></span><span begin="27.000" end="27.200">け</span><span begin="27.200" end="27.420">た</span><span begin="27.420" end="27.600">と</span><span begin="27.600" end="27.880">た</span><span begin="27.880" end="28.080">ん</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.223" end="28.493">み</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">知</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.493" end="28.840">し</span></span></span><span begin="28.840" end="29.000">ら</span><span begin="29.000" end="29.160">ぬ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.160" end="29.403">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.403" end="29.800">かい</span></span></span><span begin="29.800" end="29.960">ヘ</span><span begin="29.960" end="30.200">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">打开门的瞬间，就来到了陌生的世界。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tobira aketa totan mishiranu sekai e to</span></p><p begin="29.933" end="32.600" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="29.933" end="30.260">(そ</span><span begin="30.260" end="30.420">ん</span><span begin="30.420" end="30.600">な</span><span begin="30.600" end="30.800">の</span><span begin="30.800" end="31.020">な</span><span begin="31.020" end="31.220">い</span><span begin="31.220" end="31.380">よ)</span> <span begin="31.380" end="31.820">あ</span><span begin="31.820" end="32.120">り</span><span begin="32.120" end="32.380">え</span><span begin="32.380" end="32.480">な</span><span begin="32.480" end="32.600">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">（才没有那种事呢）不可能啦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">(sonna no nai yo) arienai</span></p><p begin="32.550" end="36.520" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.550" end="32.800">そ</span><span begin="32.800" end="33.020">れ</span><span begin="33.020" end="33.240">が</span><span begin="33.240" end="33.440">あ</span><span begin="33.440" end="33.640">り</span><span begin="33.640" end="33.820">え</span><span begin="33.820" end="34.000">る</span><span begin="34.000" end="34.220">か</span><span begin="34.220" end="34.520">も</span> <span begin="34.620" end="35.020">ミ</span><span begin="35.020" end="35.200">ル</span><span begin="35.200" end="35.343">ク</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.343" end="35.820">いろ</span></span></span><span begin="35.820" end="36.020">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">異</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.020" end="36.180">い</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">次</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.180" end="36.403">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">元</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.403" end="36.520">げん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">说不定真的有可能，牛奶色的异次元。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sore ga arieru kamo miruku-iro no ijigen</span></p><p begin="36.403" end="39.100" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="36.403" end="36.760">(コー</span><span begin="36.760" end="37.200">ヒー</span><span begin="37.200" end="37.623">カッ</span><span begin="37.623" end="37.813">プ)</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">覗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.813" end="38.400">のぞ</span></span></span><span begin="38.400" end="38.560">い</span><span begin="38.560" end="38.780">た</span><span begin="38.780" end="39.100">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">（咖啡杯）往里一看</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">(kōhī kappu) nozoitara</span></p><p begin="39.603" end="42.720" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.603" end="40.213">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="40.213" end="40.400">が</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.400" end="41.000">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="41.000" end="41.200">を</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.200" end="41.373">み</span></span></span><span begin="41.373" end="41.623">つ</span><span begin="41.623" end="41.823">め</span><span begin="41.823" end="42.023">て</span><span begin="42.023" end="42.143">ま</span><span begin="42.143" end="42.423">し</span><span begin="42.423" end="42.720">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我正凝视着我自己。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi ga watashi o mitsumete imashita</span></p><p begin="42.980" end="45.723" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.980" end="43.133">な</span><span begin="43.133" end="43.223">ん</span><span begin="43.223" end="43.613">で？</span> <span begin="44.213" end="44.623">ふ</span><span begin="44.623" end="44.823">た</span><span begin="44.823" end="45.080">り</span><span begin="45.080" end="45.220">い</span><span begin="45.220" end="45.440">る？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为什么？怎么会有两个我？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nande? futari iru?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="43.613" end="45.723"><span begin="43.613" end="43.710">(な</span><span begin="43.710" end="43.803">ん</span><span begin="43.803" end="44.213">で？</span><span begin="45.280" end="45.483">う</span><span begin="45.483" end="45.723">そ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为什么？骗人！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nande? uso!</span></span></p><p begin="45.780" end="49.000" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">困</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="45.780" end="46.200">こま</span></span></span><span begin="46.200" end="46.380">り</span><span begin="46.380" end="46.540">ま</span><span begin="46.540" end="46.780">す</span><span begin="46.780" end="46.960">ね</span> <span begin="47.420" end="47.640">お</span><span begin="47.640" end="47.800">ん</span><span begin="47.800" end="48.000">な</span><span begin="48.000" end="48.180">じ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">趣</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.180" end="48.380">しゅ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">味</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.380" end="48.803">み</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真让人为难呢，我们的兴趣居然一样。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">komarimasu ne onnaji shumi</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="46.780" end="49.000"><span begin="46.780" end="47.213">(きっ</span><span begin="47.213" end="47.500">と</span> <span begin="48.403" end="48.603">だ</span><span begin="48.603" end="48.803">か</span><span begin="48.803" end="49.000">ら)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一定是的，所以呀。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kitto dakara</span></span></p><p begin="48.803" end="50.940" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誰</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="48.803" end="49.200">だれ</span></span></span><span begin="49.200" end="50.140">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">你究竟在看着——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dare o</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="49.400" end="50.940">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="49.400" end="49.510">み</span></span></span><span begin="49.510" end="49.610">つ</span><span begin="49.610" end="49.760">め</span><span begin="49.760" end="49.860">る</span><span begin="49.860" end="50.010">の？</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.010" end="50.473">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="50.473" end="50.633">で</span><span begin="50.633" end="50.940">しょ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">谁呢？是你吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mitsumeru no? kimi desho!</span></span></p><p begin="50.960" end="55.210" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="50.960" end="51.220">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="51.220" end="51.400">だ</span><span begin="51.400" end="51.600">け</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="51.600" end="51.800">み</span></span></span><span begin="51.800" end="52.020">て</span><span begin="52.020" end="52.200">る</span><span begin="52.200" end="55.210">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我只看你一个人哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi dake miteru yo</span></p><p begin="52.183" end="58.100" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="52.183" end="52.613">こ</span><span begin="52.613" end="52.813">れ</span><span begin="52.813" end="53.020">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="53.020" end="53.803">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span begin="53.803" end="54.223">カッ</span><span begin="54.223" end="54.433">プ</span><span begin="54.433" end="54.650">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="54.650" end="55.413">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="55.413" end="55.823">の</span></span></span><span begin="55.823" end="56.023">み</span><span begin="56.023" end="56.323">ほ</span><span begin="56.323" end="56.613">し</span><span begin="56.613" end="56.893">て</span> <span begin="56.893" end="57.310">お</span><span begin="57.310" end="57.623">し</span><span begin="57.623" end="57.813">ま</span><span begin="57.813" end="58.100">い？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这是梦，杯中的梦，喝光就结束了吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kore wa yume kappu no yume nomihoshite oshimai?</span></p><p begin="58.200" end="1:00.223" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.200" end="58.363">い</span><span begin="58.363" end="58.600">つ</span><span begin="58.600" end="58.823">も</span><span begin="58.823" end="58.980">ぴょ</span><span begin="58.980" end="59.203">ん</span><span begin="59.203" end="59.360">ぴょ</span><span begin="59.360" end="59.603">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">可</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.603" end="59.823">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">能！</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.823" end="1:00.223">のう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">随时都能蹦蹦跳跳，当然可能！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo pyonpyon kanō!</span></p><p begin="1:00.223" end="1:05.190" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">楽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.223" end="1:00.760">たの</span></span></span><span begin="1:00.760" end="1:00.923">し</span><span begin="1:00.923" end="1:01.223">さ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">求</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.223" end="1:01.613">もと</span></span></span><span begin="1:01.613" end="1:01.813">め</span><span begin="1:01.813" end="1:02.023">て</span> <span begin="1:02.023" end="1:02.220">も</span><span begin="1:02.220" end="1:02.373">う</span><span begin="1:02.373" end="1:02.813">ちょっ</span><span begin="1:02.813" end="1:03.228">と</span><span begin="1:03.393" end="1:03.833">は</span><span begin="1:03.833" end="1:04.033">じ</span><span begin="1:04.033" end="1:04.223">け</span><span begin="1:04.223" end="1:04.400">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:04.400" end="1:04.823">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">追寻快乐，再稍微尽情释放一下吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tanoshisa motomete mō chotto hajikechae</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:04.574" end="1:05.190"><span begin="1:04.574" end="1:04.670">(ぴょ</span><span begin="1:04.670" end="1:04.823">ん</span><span begin="1:04.823" end="1:04.920">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:04.920" end="1:05.023">ん</span><span begin="1:05.023" end="1:05.190">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">蹦蹦跳跳地。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pyonpyon to</span></span></p><p begin="1:05.213" end="1:07.780" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.213" end="1:05.523">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.523" end="1:06.003">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="1:06.003" end="1:06.220">な</span><span begin="1:06.220" end="1:06.433">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">素</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.433" end="1:07.013">す</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">敵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:07.013" end="1:07.423">てき</span></span></span><span begin="1:07.423" end="1:07.580">だー</span><span begin="1:07.580" end="1:07.780">い！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只要在一起，就太美好啦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">issho nara suteki dāi!</span></p><p begin="1:08.003" end="1:10.920" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.003" end="1:08.423">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.423" end="1:08.620">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.620" end="1:08.773">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.773" end="1:09.033">わ</span><span begin="1:09.033" end="1:09.223">せ</span><span begin="1:09.223" end="1:09.420">た</span><span begin="1:09.420" end="1:09.603">い</span><span begin="1:09.603" end="1:09.820">か</span><span begin="1:09.820" end="1:10.460">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为想让你亲口说出来。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi ni iwasetai kara</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:10.328" end="1:10.920">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:10.328" end="1:10.420">い</span></span></span><span begin="1:10.420" end="1:10.520">い</span><span begin="1:10.520" end="1:10.623">な</span><span begin="1:10.623" end="1:10.750">さ</span><span begin="1:10.750" end="1:10.920">いっ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">快说嘛！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iinasai</span></span></p><p begin="1:10.993" end="1:12.900" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:10.993" end="1:11.213">こ</span><span begin="1:11.213" end="1:11.400">こ</span><span begin="1:11.400" end="1:11.603">ろ</span><span begin="1:11.603" end="1:11.760">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:11.760" end="1:12.023">ん</span><span begin="1:12.023" end="1:12.180">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:12.180" end="1:12.423">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.423" end="1:12.633">ま</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.633" end="1:12.900">ち？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">心儿蹦蹦跳跳，在等待吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro pyonpyon machi?</span></p><p begin="1:13.003" end="1:17.950" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">考</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.003" end="1:13.603">かんが</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.603" end="1:13.833">え</span><span begin="1:13.833" end="1:14.063">る</span><span begin="1:14.063" end="1:14.213">ふ</span><span begin="1:14.213" end="1:14.333">り</span><span begin="1:14.333" end="1:14.623">し</span><span begin="1:14.623" end="1:14.813">て</span> <span begin="1:14.813" end="1:14.980">も</span><span begin="1:14.980" end="1:15.173">う</span><span begin="1:15.173" end="1:15.613">ちょっ</span><span begin="1:15.613" end="1:16.123">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">近</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:16.123" end="1:16.793">ちか</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.793" end="1:17.020">づ</span><span begin="1:17.020" end="1:17.183">い</span><span begin="1:17.183" end="1:17.380">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:17.380" end="1:17.710">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">装作思考的样子，再稍微靠近一点吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kangaeru furi shite mō chotto chikazuichae</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:17.403" end="1:17.950"><span begin="1:17.403" end="1:17.510">(ぴょ</span><span begin="1:17.510" end="1:17.610">ん</span><span begin="1:17.610" end="1:17.690">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:17.690" end="1:17.813">ん</span><span begin="1:17.813" end="1:17.950">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">蹦蹦跳跳地。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pyonpyon to</span></span></p><p begin="1:18.003" end="1:20.700" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">簡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.003" end="1:18.423">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">単</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:18.423" end="1:18.813">たん</span></span></span><span begin="1:18.813" end="1:18.973">に</span><span begin="1:18.973" end="1:19.413">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:19.413" end="1:20.050">お</span></span></span><span begin="1:20.050" end="1:20.213">え</span><span begin="1:20.213" end="1:20.400">な</span><span begin="1:20.400" end="1:20.700">いっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易告诉你呢。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kantan ni wa oshienai</span></p><p begin="1:20.783" end="1:28.213" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.783" end="1:21.020">こ</span><span begin="1:21.020" end="1:21.213">ん</span><span begin="1:21.213" end="1:21.420">な</span><span begin="1:21.420" end="1:21.573">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:21.573" end="1:21.833">す</span></span></span><span begin="1:21.833" end="1:22.013">き</span><span begin="1:22.013" end="1:22.213">な</span><span begin="1:22.213" end="1:22.423">こ</span><span begin="1:22.423" end="1:22.643">と</span><span begin="1:22.643" end="1:24.613">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.013" end="1:25.333">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.333" end="1:25.613">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.613" end="1:25.823">な</span><span begin="1:25.823" end="1:28.213">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这么喜欢你这件事，可是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">konna ni suki na koto wa naisho na no</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:22.960" end="1:25.013">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:22.960" end="1:23.080">す</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.080" end="1:23.233">き</span><span begin="1:23.233" end="1:23.413">だっ</span><span begin="1:23.413" end="1:23.633">て</span><span begin="1:23.633" end="1:23.843">こ</span><span begin="1:23.843" end="1:24.030">と</span><span begin="1:24.030" end="1:24.230">は…</span><span begin="1:24.230" end="1:24.613">わ</span><span begin="1:24.613" end="1:24.830">わ</span><span begin="1:24.830" end="1:25.013">わ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我喜欢你这件事……哇哇哇！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suki datte koto wa… wawawa!</span></span></p><p begin="1:26.040" end="1:28.980" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:26.040" end="1:26.180">ふ</span><span begin="1:26.180" end="1:26.440">わ</span><span begin="1:26.440" end="1:26.580">ふ</span><span begin="1:26.580" end="1:26.820">わ</span><span begin="1:26.820" end="1:27.020">ど</span><span begin="1:27.020" end="1:27.160">き</span><span begin="1:27.160" end="1:27.380">ど</span><span begin="1:27.380" end="1:27.620">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.620" end="1:27.980">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.980" end="1:28.180">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.180" end="1:28.460">で</span><span begin="1:28.460" end="1:28.620">す</span><span begin="1:28.620" end="1:28.980">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho desu yo</span></p><p begin="1:29.013" end="1:32.120" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:29.013" end="1:29.403">は</span><span begin="1:29.403" end="1:29.633">じ</span><span begin="1:29.633" end="1:29.843">め</span><span begin="1:29.843" end="1:30.033">が</span><span begin="1:30.033" end="1:30.160">か</span><span begin="1:30.160" end="1:30.423">ん</span><span begin="1:30.423" end="1:30.603">じ</span><span begin="1:30.603" end="1:30.783">ん</span> <span begin="1:30.783" end="1:31.020">つー</span><span begin="1:31.020" end="1:31.213">ん</span><span begin="1:31.213" end="1:31.373">だ</span><span begin="1:31.373" end="1:31.600">つー</span><span begin="1:31.600" end="1:31.813">ん</span><span begin="1:31.813" end="1:32.120">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开头最重要，先来点小傲娇，再一点点积攒。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hajime ga kanjin tsūn da tsūn da</span></p><p begin="1:32.200" end="1:35.320" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:32.200" end="1:32.620">ふ</span><span begin="1:32.620" end="1:32.820">わ</span><span begin="1:32.820" end="1:33.000">ふ</span><span begin="1:33.000" end="1:33.200">わ</span><span begin="1:33.200" end="1:33.380">ど</span><span begin="1:33.380" end="1:33.600">き</span><span begin="1:33.600" end="1:33.780">ど</span><span begin="1:33.780" end="1:33.980">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.980" end="1:34.360">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.360" end="1:34.580">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="1:34.580" end="1:35.000">だっ</span><span begin="1:35.000" end="1:35.320">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，都说是秘密啦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho datte</span></p><p begin="1:35.420" end="1:38.180" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:35.420" end="1:35.813">い</span><span begin="1:35.813" end="1:35.983">た</span><span begin="1:35.983" end="1:36.223">ず</span><span begin="1:36.223" end="1:36.420">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.420" end="1:36.633">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.633" end="1:37.003">がお</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.003" end="1:37.203">で</span><span begin="1:37.203" end="1:37.380">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:37.380" end="1:37.793">ん</span><span begin="1:37.793" end="1:37.960">ぴょ</span><span begin="1:37.960" end="1:38.180">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带着调皮的笑容，蹦蹦跳跳。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itazura egao de pyonpyon</span></p><p begin="1:38.233" end="1:42.000" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.233" end="1:38.593">にち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.593" end="1:39.000">じょう</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.000" end="1:39.223">の</span><span begin="1:39.223" end="1:39.413">な</span><span begin="1:39.413" end="1:39.620">か</span><span begin="1:39.620" end="1:39.833">に</span><span begin="1:39.833" end="1:40.223">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">不</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.223" end="1:40.533">ふ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">思</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.533" end="1:40.800">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">議</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.800" end="1:41.023">ぎ</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.023" end="1:41.213">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">交</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.213" end="1:41.553">こう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">差</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.553" end="1:41.833">さ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">点</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.833" end="1:42.000">てん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在日常生活之中，也有不可思议的十字路口。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nichijō no naka ni mo fushigi no kōsaten</span></p><p begin="1:42.023" end="1:44.633" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:42.023" end="1:42.220">(そ</span><span begin="1:42.220" end="1:42.423">れ</span><span begin="1:42.423" end="1:42.623">な</span><span begin="1:42.623" end="1:42.820">ら</span><span begin="1:42.820" end="1:43.040">あ</span><span begin="1:43.040" end="1:43.223">る</span><span begin="1:43.223" end="1:43.413">ね)</span> <span begin="1:43.413" end="1:43.823">あ</span><span begin="1:43.823" end="1:44.160">り</span><span begin="1:44.160" end="1:44.423">え</span><span begin="1:44.423" end="1:44.520">る</span><span begin="1:44.520" end="1:44.633">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">（那样的话倒是有呢）也许真有可能。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">(sore nara aru ne) arierun</span></p><p begin="1:44.620" end="1:48.660" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.620" end="1:44.840">あ</span><span begin="1:44.840" end="1:45.020">り</span><span begin="1:45.020" end="1:45.223">え</span><span begin="1:45.223" end="1:45.420">な</span><span begin="1:45.420" end="1:45.603">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">角</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:45.603" end="1:46.013">かく</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.013" end="1:46.223">ど</span></span></span><span begin="1:46.223" end="1:46.583">に</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:46.583" end="1:47.023">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.023" end="1:47.200">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">分</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:47.200" end="1:47.423">わ</span></span></span><span begin="1:47.423" end="1:47.613">け</span><span begin="1:47.613" end="1:47.823">た</span><span begin="1:47.823" end="1:48.233">ケー</span><span begin="1:48.233" end="1:48.423">キ</span><span begin="1:48.423" end="1:48.660">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">蛋糕被切成了不可能的角度。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">arienai kakudo ni kirikaketa kēki ga</span></p><p begin="1:48.330" end="1:51.100" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="1:48.330" end="1:48.530">(さ</span><span begin="1:48.530" end="1:48.823">す</span><span begin="1:48.823" end="1:49.040">ら</span><span begin="1:49.040" end="1:49.183">い</span><span begin="1:49.183" end="1:49.320">ウ</span><span begin="1:49.320" end="1:49.600">サ</span><span begin="1:49.600" end="1:49.823">ギ)</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">呼</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:49.823" end="1:49.980">よ</span></span></span><span begin="1:49.980" end="1:50.173">ん</span><span begin="1:50.173" end="1:50.613">じゃっ</span><span begin="1:50.613" end="1:50.853">た</span><span begin="1:50.853" end="1:51.100">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">（流浪兔）不小心把它叫来啦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">(sasurai usagi) yonjatta yo</span></p><p begin="1:51.670" end="1:54.778" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:51.670" end="1:52.223">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="1:52.223" end="1:52.420">も</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">私</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:52.420" end="1:53.013">わたし</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.013" end="1:53.220">と</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">驚</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:53.220" end="1:53.813">おどろ</span></span></span><span begin="1:53.813" end="1:54.013">き</span><span begin="1:54.013" end="1:54.153">ま</span><span begin="1:54.153" end="1:54.413">し</span><span begin="1:54.413" end="1:54.778">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我也和我自己一起吃了一惊。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">watashi mo watashi to odorokimashita</span></p><p begin="1:54.960" end="1:57.813" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.960" end="1:55.140">な</span><span begin="1:55.140" end="1:55.220">ん</span><span begin="1:55.220" end="1:55.560">で？</span> <span begin="1:56.160" end="1:56.580">しゃ</span><span begin="1:56.580" end="1:56.820">べ</span><span begin="1:56.820" end="1:56.980">る</span><span begin="1:56.980" end="1:57.220">ウ</span><span begin="1:57.220" end="1:57.480">サ？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为什么？会说话的兔子？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nande? shaberu usa?</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:55.600" end="1:57.813"><span begin="1:55.600" end="1:55.700">(な</span><span begin="1:55.700" end="1:55.820">ん</span><span begin="1:55.820" end="1:56.100">で？</span> <span begin="1:57.403" end="1:57.593">ま</span><span begin="1:57.593" end="1:57.813">じ！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">为什么？真的假的！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">nande? maji!</span></span></p><p begin="1:57.813" end="2:00.790" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">困</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.813" end="1:58.200">こま</span></span></span><span begin="1:58.200" end="1:58.413">り</span><span begin="1:58.413" end="1:58.533">ま</span><span begin="1:58.533" end="1:58.800">し</span><span begin="1:58.800" end="1:59.070">た</span> <span begin="1:59.423" end="1:59.580">お</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">茶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:59.580" end="1:59.800">ちゃ</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.800" end="2:00.003">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:00.003" end="2:00.200">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:00.200" end="2:00.400">ん</span><span begin="2:00.400" end="2:00.700">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真伤脑筋，喝口茶——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">komarimashita ocha o nonde</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:58.800" end="2:00.790">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">熱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:58.800" end="1:59.153">あつ</span></span></span><span begin="1:59.153" end="1:59.423">い</span> <span begin="2:00.220" end="2:00.460">そ</span><span begin="2:00.460" end="2:00.600">う</span><span begin="2:00.600" end="2:00.790">だ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">好烫，对了。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">atsui sō da</span></span></p><p begin="2:00.790" end="2:02.530" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.790" end="2:01.000">つ</span><span begin="2:01.000" end="2:01.220">い</span><span begin="2:01.220" end="2:02.530">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">终于——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tsui ni</span></p><p begin="2:01.421" end="2:03.013" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v2"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">見</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:01.421" end="2:01.521">み</span></span></span><span begin="2:01.521" end="2:01.630">つ</span><span begin="2:01.630" end="2:01.740">け</span><span begin="2:01.740" end="2:01.851">た</span><span begin="2:01.851" end="2:02.011">よ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.011" end="2:02.460">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:02.460" end="2:02.620">へ</span><span begin="2:02.620" end="2:03.013">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我找到了哦，通往你的——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mitsuketa yo kimi e no</span></p><p begin="2:03.013" end="2:07.630" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.013" end="2:03.223">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.223" end="2:03.433">と</span><span begin="2:03.433" end="2:03.600">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">運</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:03.600" end="2:04.023">うん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">命</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.023" end="2:07.630">めい</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">与你相伴的命运。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi to no unmei</span></p><p begin="2:04.023" end="2:10.080" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:04.023" end="2:04.320">い</span><span begin="2:04.320" end="2:04.620">い</span><span begin="2:04.620" end="2:04.813">よ</span><span begin="2:04.813" end="2:05.160">ね</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.160" end="2:05.813">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.813" end="2:06.390">こい</span></span></span><span begin="2:06.390" end="2:06.620">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.620" end="2:07.383">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">初</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.383" end="2:08.013">はじ</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.013" end="2:08.143">め</span><span begin="2:08.143" end="2:08.623">て</span><span begin="2:08.623" end="2:09.013">の</span> <span begin="2:09.013" end="2:09.423">と</span><span begin="2:09.423" end="2:09.623">き</span><span begin="2:09.623" end="2:09.813">め</span><span begin="2:09.813" end="2:10.080">き？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真好啊，梦，恋爱的梦，是初次心动吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ii yo ne yume koi no yume hajimete no tokimeki?</span></p><p begin="2:10.173" end="2:12.123" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">胸</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.173" end="2:10.603">むね</span></span></span><span begin="2:10.603" end="2:10.813">が</span><span begin="2:10.813" end="2:11.060">ら</span><span begin="2:11.060" end="2:11.213">ん</span><span begin="2:11.213" end="2:11.440">ら</span><span begin="2:11.440" end="2:11.640">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">歌</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.640" end="2:12.000">うた</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.000" end="2:12.123">う！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">心中正朗朗地歌唱！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">mune ga ranran utau!</span></p><p begin="2:12.123" end="2:17.160" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.123" end="2:12.583">ス</span><span begin="2:12.583" end="2:13.013">キッ</span><span begin="2:13.013" end="2:13.113">プ</span><span begin="2:13.113" end="2:13.393">し</span><span begin="2:13.393" end="2:13.593">な</span><span begin="2:13.593" end="2:13.800">が</span><span begin="2:13.800" end="2:14.023">ら</span> <span begin="2:14.023" end="2:14.220">は</span><span begin="2:14.220" end="2:14.413">に</span><span begin="2:14.413" end="2:14.620">か</span><span begin="2:14.620" end="2:14.813">ん</span><span begin="2:14.813" end="2:15.263">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誘っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.263" end="2:16.223">さそ</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.223" end="2:16.400">て</span><span begin="2:16.400" end="2:16.680">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">一边轻快地跳着，一边害羞地来邀请我呀。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sukippu shinagara hanikande sasotte yo</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:16.643" end="2:17.160"><span begin="2:16.643" end="2:16.740">(ら</span><span begin="2:16.740" end="2:16.813">ん</span><span begin="2:16.813" end="2:16.920">ら</span><span begin="2:16.920" end="2:17.023">ん</span><span begin="2:17.023" end="2:17.160">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">朗朗地。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ranran to</span></span></p><p begin="2:17.213" end="2:19.820" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.213" end="2:17.413">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:17.413" end="2:18.003">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="2:18.003" end="2:18.233">な</span><span begin="2:18.233" end="2:18.613">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:18.613" end="2:19.033">む</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">敵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.033" end="2:19.413">てき</span></span></span><span begin="2:19.413" end="2:19.580">だー</span><span begin="2:19.580" end="2:19.820">い！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只要在一起就无敌啦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">issho nara muteki dāi!</span></p><p begin="2:20.003" end="2:22.813" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">本</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.003" end="2:20.413">ほん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.413" end="2:20.613">ね</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.613" end="2:20.843">か</span><span begin="2:20.843" end="2:20.933">く</span><span begin="2:20.933" end="2:21.223">せ</span><span begin="2:21.223" end="2:21.400">な</span><span begin="2:21.400" end="2:21.613">く</span><span begin="2:21.613" end="2:21.793">な</span><span begin="2:21.793" end="2:22.813">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">渐渐藏不住真心话了。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">honne kakusenaku naru</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:22.180" end="2:22.813">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">本</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.180" end="2:22.380">ほん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">音</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.380" end="2:22.593">ね</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.593" end="2:22.813">だっ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">是真心话！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">honne da</span></span></p><p begin="2:22.930" end="2:24.840" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.930" end="2:23.113">あ</span><span begin="2:23.113" end="2:23.413">し</span><span begin="2:23.413" end="2:23.613">た</span><span begin="2:23.613" end="2:23.810">ら</span><span begin="2:23.810" end="2:24.023">ん</span><span begin="2:24.023" end="2:24.210">ら</span><span begin="2:24.210" end="2:24.403">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">希</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.403" end="2:24.633">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">望？</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.633" end="2:24.840">ぼう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">明天也会灿烂地充满希望吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita ranran kibō?</span></p><p begin="2:25.000" end="2:30.010" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.000" end="2:25.613">いま</span></span></span><span begin="2:25.613" end="2:25.820">す</span><span begin="2:25.820" end="2:26.000">ぐ</span><span begin="2:26.000" end="2:26.220">が</span><span begin="2:26.220" end="2:26.410">い</span><span begin="2:26.410" end="2:26.600">い</span><span begin="2:26.600" end="2:26.833">な</span> <span begin="2:26.833" end="2:27.000">は</span><span begin="2:27.000" end="2:27.213">に</span><span begin="2:27.213" end="2:27.400">か</span><span begin="2:27.400" end="2:27.613">ん</span><span begin="2:27.613" end="2:27.920">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">誘っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.083" end="2:29.023">さそ</span></span></span><span begin="2:29.023" end="2:29.243">て</span><span begin="2:29.243" end="2:29.560">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我希望是现在马上，害羞地来邀请我呀。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ima sugu ga ii na hanikande sasotte yo</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:29.413" end="2:30.010"><span begin="2:29.413" end="2:29.520">(ら</span><span begin="2:29.520" end="2:29.613">ん</span><span begin="2:29.613" end="2:29.710">ら</span><span begin="2:29.710" end="2:29.823">ん</span><span begin="2:29.823" end="2:30.010">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">朗朗地。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ranran to</span></span></p><p begin="2:30.030" end="2:32.580" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.030" end="2:30.340">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">瞬</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.340" end="2:30.800">しゅん</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.800" end="2:30.980">だ</span><span begin="2:30.980" end="2:31.280">け</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">耳</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.413" end="2:32.013">みみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.013" end="2:32.223">も</span><span begin="2:32.223" end="2:32.580">と</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">仅仅一瞬间，在耳边。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">isshun dake mimimoto</span></p><p begin="2:32.793" end="2:39.740" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.793" end="2:33.040">ほ</span><span begin="2:33.040" end="2:33.223">ん</span><span begin="2:33.223" end="2:33.440">と</span><span begin="2:33.440" end="2:33.653">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:33.653" end="2:33.813">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:33.813" end="2:34.023">き</span><span begin="2:34.023" end="2:34.193">な</span><span begin="2:34.193" end="2:34.413">ん</span><span begin="2:34.413" end="2:34.613">だ</span><span begin="2:34.613" end="2:36.813">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">囁</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:36.813" end="2:37.823">ささや</span></span></span><span begin="2:37.823" end="2:39.740">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">低声呢喃着，其实我是喜欢你的。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">honto wa suki nan da to sasayaku</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:35.000" end="2:37.003">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:35.000" end="2:35.120">す</span></span></span><span begin="2:35.120" end="2:35.243">き</span><span begin="2:35.243" end="2:35.340">な</span><span begin="2:35.340" end="2:35.423">ん</span><span begin="2:35.423" end="2:35.580">だ</span><span begin="2:35.580" end="2:35.800">つ</span><span begin="2:35.800" end="2:36.000">ま</span><span begin="2:36.000" end="2:36.233">り…</span><span begin="2:36.233" end="2:36.610">な</span><span begin="2:36.610" end="2:36.813">な</span><span begin="2:36.813" end="2:37.003">な！)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">也就是说我喜欢你……啊啊啊！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">suki nan da tsumari… nanana!</span></span></p><p begin="2:47.393" end="2:53.213" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="2:47.393" end="2:47.800">こ</span><span begin="2:47.800" end="2:48.000">れ</span><span begin="2:48.000" end="2:48.180">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:48.180" end="2:48.960">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span begin="2:48.960" end="2:49.380">カッ</span><span begin="2:49.380" end="2:49.600">プ</span><span begin="2:49.600" end="2:49.780">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:49.780" end="2:50.580">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">飲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:50.580" end="2:50.980">の</span></span></span><span begin="2:50.980" end="2:51.160">み</span><span begin="2:51.160" end="2:51.340">ほ</span><span begin="2:51.340" end="2:51.780">し</span><span begin="2:51.780" end="2:52.180">て</span><span begin="2:52.180" end="2:52.580">お</span><span begin="2:52.580" end="2:52.800">ね</span><span begin="2:52.800" end="2:52.920">が</span><span begin="2:52.920" end="2:53.213">い！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这是梦，杯中的梦，请把它喝光吧！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kore wa yume kappu no yume nomihoshite onegai!</span></p><p begin="2:53.380" end="2:55.360" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:53.380" end="2:53.580">い</span><span begin="2:53.580" end="2:53.800">つ</span><span begin="2:53.800" end="2:54.020">も</span><span begin="2:54.020" end="2:54.200">ぴょ</span><span begin="2:54.200" end="2:54.400">ん</span><span begin="2:54.400" end="2:54.600">ぴょ</span><span begin="2:54.600" end="2:54.800">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">可</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:54.800" end="2:55.033">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">能！</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.033" end="2:55.360">のう</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">随时都能蹦蹦跳跳，当然可能！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itsumo pyonpyon kanō!</span></p><p begin="2:55.380" end="3:00.380" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">楽</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:55.380" end="2:55.980">たの</span></span></span><span begin="2:55.980" end="2:56.160">し</span><span begin="2:56.160" end="2:56.400">さ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">求</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:56.400" end="2:56.800">もと</span></span></span><span begin="2:56.800" end="2:57.000">め</span><span begin="2:57.000" end="2:57.180">て</span> <span begin="2:57.180" end="2:57.340">も</span><span begin="2:57.340" end="2:57.540">う</span><span begin="2:57.540" end="2:58.000">ちょっ</span><span begin="2:58.000" end="2:58.580">と</span><span begin="2:58.580" end="2:59.000">は</span><span begin="2:59.000" end="2:59.180">じ</span><span begin="2:59.180" end="2:59.400">け</span><span begin="2:59.400" end="2:59.580">ちゃ</span><span begin="2:59.580" end="2:59.840">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">追寻快乐，再稍微尽情释放一下吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tanoshisa motomete mō chotto hajikechae</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="2:59.850" end="3:00.380"><span begin="2:59.850" end="2:59.913">(ぴ</span><span begin="2:59.913" end="2:59.950">ょ</span><span begin="2:59.950" end="3:00.020">ん</span><span begin="3:00.020" end="3:00.100">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:00.100" end="3:00.223">ん</span><span begin="3:00.223" end="3:00.380">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">蹦蹦跳跳地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pyonpyon to</span></span></p><p begin="3:00.420" end="3:03.000" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">一</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.420" end="3:00.780">いっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:00.780" end="3:01.180">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="3:01.180" end="3:01.420">な</span><span begin="3:01.420" end="3:01.740">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">素</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:01.740" end="3:02.340">す</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">敵</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:02.340" end="3:02.620">てき</span></span></span><span begin="3:02.620" end="3:02.740">だー</span><span begin="3:02.740" end="3:03.000">い！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只要在一起，就太美好啦！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">issho nara suteki dāi!</span></p><p begin="3:03.160" end="3:06.080" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.160" end="3:03.600">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="3:03.600" end="3:03.840">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:03.840" end="3:04.040">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:04.040" end="3:04.180">わ</span><span begin="3:04.180" end="3:04.420">せ</span><span begin="3:04.420" end="3:04.620">た</span><span begin="3:04.620" end="3:04.800">い</span><span begin="3:04.800" end="3:05.040">か</span><span begin="3:05.040" end="3:05.460">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为想让你亲口说出来。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi ni iwasetai kara</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:05.390" end="3:06.080">(<span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:05.390" end="3:05.480">い</span></span></span><span begin="3:05.480" end="3:05.613">い</span><span begin="3:05.613" end="3:05.740">な</span><span begin="3:05.740" end="3:05.920">さ</span><span begin="3:05.920" end="3:06.080">いっ)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">快说嘛！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">iinasai</span></span></p><p begin="3:06.200" end="3:08.060" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.200" end="3:06.413">こ</span><span begin="3:06.413" end="3:06.620">こ</span><span begin="3:06.620" end="3:06.800">ろ</span><span begin="3:06.800" end="3:06.940">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:06.940" end="3:07.180">ん</span><span begin="3:07.180" end="3:07.340">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:07.340" end="3:07.600">ん</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">待</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:07.600" end="3:07.800">ま</span></span></span><span begin="3:07.800" end="3:08.060">ち？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">心儿蹦蹦跳跳，在等待吗？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kokoro pyonpyon machi?</span></p><p begin="3:08.193" end="3:13.190" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">考</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:08.193" end="3:08.790">かんが</span></span></span><span begin="3:08.790" end="3:08.973">え</span><span begin="3:08.973" end="3:09.180">る</span><span begin="3:09.180" end="3:09.413">ふ</span><span begin="3:09.413" end="3:09.523">り</span><span begin="3:09.523" end="3:09.813">し</span><span begin="3:09.813" end="3:10.023">て</span> <span begin="3:10.023" end="3:10.240">も</span><span begin="3:10.240" end="3:10.373">う</span><span begin="3:10.373" end="3:10.803">ちょっ</span><span begin="3:10.803" end="3:11.323">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">近</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:11.323" end="3:11.993">ちか</span></span></span><span begin="3:11.993" end="3:12.220">づ</span><span begin="3:12.220" end="3:12.443">い</span><span begin="3:12.443" end="3:12.580">ちゃ</span><span begin="3:12.580" end="3:12.860">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">装作思考的样子，再稍微靠近一点吧。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kangaeru furi shite mō chotto chikazuichae</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="3:12.653" end="3:13.190"><span begin="3:12.653" end="3:12.770">(ぴょ</span><span begin="3:12.770" end="3:12.850">ん</span><span begin="3:12.850" end="3:12.940">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:12.940" end="3:13.033">ん</span><span begin="3:13.033" end="3:13.190">と)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">蹦蹦跳跳地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">pyonpyon to</span></span></p><p begin="3:13.210" end="3:15.880" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">簡</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.210" end="3:13.600">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">単</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:13.600" end="3:14.020">たん</span></span></span><span begin="3:14.020" end="3:14.220">に</span><span begin="3:14.220" end="3:14.460">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">教</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:14.600" end="3:15.180">お</span></span></span><span begin="3:15.180" end="3:15.420">え</span><span begin="3:15.420" end="3:15.600">な</span><span begin="3:15.600" end="3:15.880">いっ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">才不会轻易告诉你呢。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kantan ni wa oshienai</span></p><p begin="3:15.960" end="3:20.850" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:15.960" end="3:16.220">こ</span><span begin="3:16.220" end="3:16.420">ん</span><span begin="3:16.420" end="3:16.640">な</span><span begin="3:16.640" end="3:16.780">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:16.780" end="3:17.000">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:17.000" end="3:17.220">き</span><span begin="3:17.220" end="3:17.380">な</span><span begin="3:17.380" end="3:17.620">こ</span><span begin="3:17.620" end="3:17.820">と</span><span begin="3:17.820" end="3:20.850">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这么喜欢你这件事——</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">konna ni suki na koto wa</span></p><p begin="3:17.810" end="3:23.413" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:17.810" end="3:17.990">い</span><span begin="3:17.990" end="3:18.203">い</span><span begin="3:18.203" end="3:18.403">よ</span><span begin="3:18.403" end="3:18.800">ね</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:18.800" end="3:19.403">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">恋</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:19.403" end="3:20.013">こい</span></span></span><span begin="3:20.013" end="3:20.180">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:20.180" end="3:21.140">ゆめ</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">好</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:21.320" end="3:21.500">す</span></span></span><span begin="3:21.500" end="3:21.620">き</span><span begin="3:21.620" end="3:21.740">な</span><span begin="3:21.740" end="3:21.813">ん</span><span begin="3:21.813" end="3:21.960">だ</span><span begin="3:21.960" end="3:22.213">つ</span><span begin="3:22.213" end="3:22.413">ま</span><span begin="3:22.413" end="3:22.613">り…</span><span begin="3:22.613" end="3:23.013">な</span><span begin="3:23.013" end="3:23.213">な</span><span begin="3:23.213" end="3:23.413">な！</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">真好啊，梦，恋爱的梦，也就是说我喜欢你……啊啊啊！</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ii yo ne yume koi no yume suki nan da tsumari… nanana!</span></p><p begin="3:23.433" end="3:26.823" itunes:key="L60" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.433" end="3:23.780">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:23.780" end="3:24.000">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="3:24.000" end="3:24.200">な</span><span begin="3:24.200" end="3:26.823">の</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">naisho na no</span></p><p begin="3:24.420" end="3:27.360" itunes:key="L61" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:24.420" end="3:24.600">ふ</span><span begin="3:24.600" end="3:24.820">わ</span><span begin="3:24.820" end="3:25.000">ふ</span><span begin="3:25.000" end="3:25.240">わ</span><span begin="3:25.240" end="3:25.450">ど</span><span begin="3:25.450" end="3:25.600">き</span><span begin="3:25.600" end="3:25.750">ど</span><span begin="3:25.750" end="3:26.023">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.023" end="3:26.300">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:26.300" end="3:26.613">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="3:26.613" end="3:26.823">で</span><span begin="3:26.823" end="3:27.000">す</span><span begin="3:27.000" end="3:27.360">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，是秘密哦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho desu yo</span></p><p begin="3:27.360" end="3:30.540" itunes:key="L62" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:27.360" end="3:27.780">は</span><span begin="3:27.780" end="3:28.020">じ</span><span begin="3:28.020" end="3:28.200">め</span><span begin="3:28.200" end="3:28.420">が</span><span begin="3:28.420" end="3:28.620">か</span><span begin="3:28.620" end="3:28.820">ん</span><span begin="3:28.820" end="3:28.960">じ</span><span begin="3:28.960" end="3:29.200">ん</span> <span begin="3:29.200" end="3:29.360">つー</span><span begin="3:29.360" end="3:29.600">ん</span><span begin="3:29.600" end="3:29.780">だ</span><span begin="3:29.780" end="3:30.000">つー</span><span begin="3:30.000" end="3:30.200">ん</span><span begin="3:30.200" end="3:30.540">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">开头最重要，先来点小傲娇，再一点点积攒。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">hajime ga kanjin tsūn da tsūn da</span></p><p begin="3:30.580" end="3:33.740" itunes:key="L63" ttm:agent="v2"><span begin="3:30.580" end="3:31.000">ふ</span><span begin="3:31.000" end="3:31.200">わ</span><span begin="3:31.200" end="3:31.433">ふ</span><span begin="3:31.433" end="3:31.603">わ</span><span begin="3:31.603" end="3:31.783">ど</span><span begin="3:31.783" end="3:32.000">き</span><span begin="3:32.000" end="3:32.180">ど</span><span begin="3:32.180" end="3:32.380">き</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">内</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.380" end="3:32.713">ない</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">緒</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:32.713" end="3:33.013">しょ</span></span></span><span begin="3:33.013" end="3:33.400">だっ</span><span begin="3:33.400" end="3:33.740">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">轻飘飘，心怦怦，都说是秘密啦。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">fuwafuwa dokidoki naisho datte</span></p><p begin="3:33.820" end="3:36.668" itunes:key="L64" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:33.820" end="3:34.223">い</span><span begin="3:34.223" end="3:34.393">た</span><span begin="3:34.393" end="3:34.633">ず</span><span begin="3:34.633" end="3:34.820">ら</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:34.820" end="3:35.033">え</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">顔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="3:35.033" end="3:35.423">がお</span></span></span><span begin="3:35.423" end="3:35.623">で</span> <span begin="3:35.623" end="3:35.800">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:35.800" end="3:36.193">ん</span><span begin="3:36.193" end="3:36.420">ぴょ</span><span begin="3:36.420" end="3:36.668">ん</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">带着调皮的笑容，蹦蹦跳跳。</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">itazura egao de pyonpyon</span></p></div></body></tt>